WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.450
Someone hands you a flask of acid.

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:05.670
They don't know how strong
it is, and neither do you.

3
00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:08.810
You can't pick out what's
dissolved in it and weigh it.

4
00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:12.010
Yet with a burette and a second
solution whose concentration

5
00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:17.010
you do know, you can work out
the acid's concentration exactly.

6
00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:20.630
How can measuring a volume tell
you how much is dissolved?

7
00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:23.690
In this mission, you'll see
how concentration is measured,

8
00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:27.200
in grams and in moles
per cubic decimetre.

9
00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:31.230
You'll find out how a titration
finds the exact volume of one

10
00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:35.590
solution that reacts with another,
and how to use that volume.

11
00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:39.610
Your mission: find the
concentration of the mystery acid.
